# Line endings are LF in the repository, everywhere.
#
# Not a style preference: a tool that rewrites a file with the other convention
# turns its next diff into "every line changed", which hides the actual edit and
# makes the history useless for the one thing history is for. That has already
# happened once here, to three files in a single commit.
#
# `* text=auto` normalises on the way in, so it no longer matters what a script
# or an editor wrote locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, byte-for-byte.
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.reg binary
